From 7d0e1b5e1b9f0698b9e1c9c30f19e4ef66ee666e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 23:29:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] State: add accelerator fault and recovery events

These events provide a common mechanism for reporting
accelerator fault conditions, status changes, and recovery
events, while allowing the event to be associated with an
accelerator inventory object.

Change-Id: If49910e4d848df223bf7e5adb8b7fa48a271e79a
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
